Explanation of the change:

- We pull the `<WarningFilled16>` node out of its old spot at the top of the field and drop it in after the menu icon.  That ordering allows the ComboBox’s own CSS rule for `.bx--combo-box__invalid-icon` to properly position the alert icon at the far right of the input.
- We switch the class on the warning icon from the ListBox style (`--list-box__invalid-icon`) to the ComboBox style (`--combo-box__invalid-icon`).
- We add a `className={`${prefix}--combo-box__selection`}` on the clear-selection node so that it no longer pulls in the ListBox “tag” styling, but instead uses the ComboBox’s clear-icon styling.
